# The Vercel image builds from backend/ as its context, so it needs its own exclusions: a
# .dockerignore is only read from the root of the context in use.
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
*.user
*.suo

# Secrets never enter an image. The pattern covers every per-environment variant, such as
# appsettings.Secrets.supabase-staging.json.
**/appsettings.Secrets*.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
local-credentials.txt
*.bak
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
